Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: kitty
Source: https://github.com/itsmygithubacct/kitty
Comment:
 The upstream tarball is written by debian/make-orig.sh. Besides the
 repository tree it holds the Go modules under vendor/ (from "go mod
 vendor", each with the licence file its module ships) and one font under
 fonts/ from the Nerd Fonts project, release v3.4.0, "NerdFontsSymbolsOnly".
 Holders are listed by name as the licence files give them.

